<title>USA: PMC ups qtrly div to $0.30/shr.</title>
<headline>PMC ups qtrly div to $0.30/shr.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>PMC Capital Inc said on Monday it increased its quarterly dividend to $0.30 from $0.295, and set a special payout of $0.02 a share.</p>
<p>Both the quarterly and special dividends would be payable on January 13 to shareholders of record on December 31.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
